  "result": "Perfect! All 167 tests pass. I've successfully implemented voucher support:\n\n**Updated `src/errors.js`:**\n- Added `VOUCHER_EXISTS`: \"Invoice already has a voucher applied.\"\n\n**Updated `src/invoices.js`:**\n\n**`invoiceTotals` function** now:\n- Returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }`\n- Calculates voucher as `invoice.voucher?.amount || 0`\n- Calculates total as `subtotal - discount + vat - voucher`\n- Still clamps total at 0 with `Math.max(0, ...)`\n\n**Added `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })`** function:\n- Adds a fixed-amount voucher to a draft invoice\n- Voucher is applied AFTER VAT (not affected by discounts/VAT)\n- Returns ok(newInvoice) with invoice.voucher = { code, amount }\n- Returns error for:\n  - `NOT_DRAFT` if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n  - `VOUCHER_EXISTS` if invoice already has a voucher\n  - `AMOUNT_INVALID` if amount isn't a positive integer\n- Does not mutate the original invoice\n\n**Added 9 comprehensive tests** covering:\n- Adding voucher to draft invoice\n- Voucher reducing total in invoiceTotals\n- Rejection on non-draft invoices\n- Rejection of duplicate vouchers\n- Amount validation (zero, negative, decimal)\n- No mutation of original invoice\n- Voucher included in invoiceTotals calculations\n- Voucher working correctly with discounts and VAT\n- Total clamped to zero even with large vouchers\n\nAll 167 tests pass (158 previous + 9 new). Vouchers are now fully integrated and correctly applied after all other calculations (discount, VAT).",
